rdV2C4LAz3-hahsgu1mkpdcIYBvOJqk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKCRd69uLHwNqqjW8HJi8vpMTVeF13hXtQsxefQup4c3w&oe=6AAA9E32"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot(1)_2560_1440.png", "id": "2100665936973153", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982680_2100665940306486_5664456920141678252_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_IIKJmONy8YQ7kNvwFXZ33I&_nc_oc=AdotNI5M0JEYqevc21fhVhYZXDg1HiCwxFOQUw1B3c9XnIgovNw9GuOyDekNacrgU_g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIybtUp2nW4yc0morjFkOhN2owSBWa_rZrGMYRfBzZ-Vw&oe=6AAA8B57"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover Image.png", "id": "368600119311127", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001730_368600122644460_5598028405797075028_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8KUuq0bzIhAQ7kNvwFEpTTD&_nc_oc=AdoLyvNwBDA7tU6uu0_mwRwEV-KBlomlxROrjtys7mWrSzfV3VkQNcLEteLeTJ77R-I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIsLu883ShZsFeI7eVQoaImx31d8QHwXS8fixZEhNss0Q&oe=6AAA9095"}, "display_name": "2035 Carbon neutrality of smart green city", "keywords": [], "long_description": "It is a VR content that allows teenagers to experience a space for carbon neutrality, learn about the need for carbon neutrality, what they can do, and explore future career paths.\n\n1. Experience goal\n- Discover specific career topics in promising future industries and occupations against the backdrop of a smart green city in 2035\n- Explore a future path by experiencing a space for carbon neutrality\n- Learn about the need for carbon neutrality and what young people can do\n- Learn about core underlying technologies such as realistic content technology provided as an experience\n\n2. Characteristics of content\n- First-person perspective in which the experiencer becomes the main character\n- 7-step composition according to the actual experience process\n- Developed based on standing only\n- Movement and manipulation using the Oculus Controller\n- Estimated experience time of about 20 to 30 minutes\n\n3. 7-step configuration\nSTEP 1 Instructions on how to operate\nSTEP 2 Meeting with the UN Youth Delegation\nSTEP 3 Practicing carbon neutrality in urban forests\nSTEP 4 Implementation of carbon neutrality in wind power plants\nSTEP 5 Carbon neutrality practice at the East Coast carbon storage site\nSTEP 6 Think\nSTEP 7 Finishing\n", "short_description": "It is a VR content that allows teenagers to experience a space for carbon neutrality, learn about the need for carbon neutrality, what they can do, and explore future career paths."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "HeroCover_3000x900.png", "id": "7527653000591853", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001730_7527653007258519_8435369833685824333_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0LSbdW76SFIQ7kNvwEpYfCr&_nc_oc=Adp_I2g9eoKfTDpQoLcc442IvZPG-iYv_4tLHmMF6rFB5c6-hXnntK0ferflrWJVRU0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLlfJyAObpKWiOd9QmK-JtqLeeMBMrqpGAF-TGUqgx2Aw&oe=6AAAA442"}, {"file_name": "Landscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "1452940842279363", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031355_1452940845612696_1891464877969558457_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=G3zT2EwK0bYQ7kNvwE-pMGl&_nc_oc=AdpbHXwWjowtSWYESJQ1xEcFVOEOA3B92iH4T97sly77ujCpx2jdYE-2DO27JFXDQUo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQI-zaBxAQuFLhSYgR9hXty90sESRIGO0TyNjMksEbr3yA&oe=6AAA8AC4"}, {"file_name": "Portrait_1008x1440.png", "id": "959181839136200", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566686_959181842469533_2388841801262298119_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FSSxxDcsaewQ7kNvwHQidP2&_nc_oc=AdpRs9_q4nsE4yudsdCI3kYEiKx3Cb28kWJ2TIG1yV81alonqc23tbyze4awF4s